2. **Sharpen the distinction between founder replacement labour and owner surplus in Section 5:** Ensure prose strictly separates market labour replacement expense from equity surplus.
3. **Explicitly note the block-to-hourly derivation for ArboNed in Section 5:** Note that the €192/hour comparator derives directly from the €384/2h published block.

