codex
The legal threshold objection is valid. The enforcement objection is subtler: the underlying Inspectorate PDF does support warnings and requirements, but the saved excerpt does not, so it still fails this book’s receipt rule. I also found more consequential misses around when hygienist input is required and whether the 90-day pass actually tests the verdict’s €5,500 assumption.
